        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors are pursuing the development and/or acquisition of pharmaceuticals, medical devices and OTC products that target the same diseases and conditions that we are targeting in dermatology.",
        "start_character": 42719,
        "end_character": 42918
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037874",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors are pursuing the development and/or acquisition of pharmaceuticals, medical devices and over-the-counter (“OTC”) products that target the same diseases and conditions that we are targeting in biotechnology, biopharmaceutical, dermatological and other therapeutic areas.",
        "start_character": 41608,
        "end_character": 41893
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037874",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The only pharmaceutical area in which we sell marketed products is dermatology, and the dermatology competitive landscape is highly fragmented, with a large number of mid-size and smaller companies competing in both the prescription sector and the OTC sector.",
        "start_character": 42459,
        "end_character": 42718
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037874",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The process of seeking required approvals before we can market or sell a product, and the continuing need for compliance with applicable statutes and regulations require the expenditure of substantial resources and we cannot guarantee that we will be able to obtain the appropriate marketing authorization for any product candidate.",
        "start_character": 48801,
        "end_character": 49133
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037874",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through our subsidiary Cellvation, we are developing CEVA-D, a novel bioreactor device that is designed to enhance the anti-inflammatory potency of bone marrow-derived cells without genetic manipulation, using wall shear stress to suppress tumor necrosis factor-a production by activated immune cells.",
        "start_character": 33899,
        "end_character": 34200
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037874",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through our subsidiary Cyprium, we are developing adeno-associated virus (“AAV”)-based gene therapy (“AAV-ATP7A”) for the treatment of Menkes disease.",
        "start_character": 32105,
        "end_character": 32255
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037874",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through our subsidiary Helocyte, we are developing Triplex, a universal recombinant Modified Vaccinia Ankara viral vector vaccine engineered to induce a rapid, robust and durable virus-specific T cell response to three immuno-dominant proteins (UL83 (pp65), UL123 (IE1), and UL122 (IE2)) linked to cytomegalovirus (“CMV”).",
        "start_character": 12164,
        "end_character": 12486
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-037874",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also depend upon the skills, knowledge, experience and know-how of our management and research and development personnel, as well as that of our advisers, consultants and other contractors.",
        "start_character": 39838,
        "end_character": 40030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-037874",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-037874-38bbc98beff41e5f",
